 'Exact None4 driver and None3 observer source binding; complete reversal and function/class AST preservation; five Root PS copies byte-exact, unchanged child TEMPLATE; existing M3 capture six-literal observed-span reversal and four CR-preserving two-literal PS reversals authenticate genuine selected source receipts.',
 'Config20, eight fixed program paths/argv routes, canonical coordinate pointer3, Guard static peer copy and fixed source row3 interfaces match all four stage readers. Nine final and staging paths must be absent before first write; fsync/readback/non-replacing rename; partial failures are consumed and require distinct namespace.',
 'Acyclic order: preliminary architecture/binder peers then actual finite lease and M3 source bindings, binder configuration C, different actual bound P16 resolving phaseargv8, physical INIT, externally correlated RootTrust8, post-trust utility/composer models and different actual pool20, READY13/9 and GO13 before original capture timer. Composer TEMPLATE only is selected by C.',
 'Main authenticates P16 and provenance pointer plus same source/C/INIT trust; actual independent metadata Core12 phase-specific type/verdict and original Py6 stamp, different bound/late READY6 and RootTrust8/GO13 closed nominals are explicit. Source peer does not claim independent OS/tool attestation.',
 'Complete post-trust source pool gate before auth_before, repeated before each metadata packet; exact actual utility/composer/model hashes and READY linkage. Separate direct fixed BASE packet helper grants no reviewer decision.',
 'Original context and runtime stamps are never refreshed: shared minimum original600 deadline, both90 before unit readiness, resource60 through spawn in accepted GG6, physical Root450 plus original post-unit60. Wait-Record guards existing records before/after reads; each independent core/detail and final FINISHED rechecks lease/deadlines; after spawn bounds clip to remaining original60.',
 'Finite native PS7 phase lease12 max43200 and genuine seventh-tick chronology remain separate from ongoing master27/endNone and historical peer19. Selected direct command physical capture65536 per stream, finite argv64 and owned direct reap/drain/refusal evidence reviewed; failures require observer cleanup audit and never imply Job/descendant cleanup.',
 'Whole-before/after metadata source routes, original authorization pointers, current driver20 versus physical Root18 bridge, actualACK links and byte-identical scoped WORK copy/provenance are checked by stage readers and independent actual checker; standalone main never launches unit.',
