 'This accepts preliminary source architecture and binder preparation only. Actual configuration C and reversible source bindings require their own genuine different full audit; future actual P16 and argv rows must be derived from observed C and source provenance, before physical INIT.',
 'Root must externally select the authentic architecture/binder receipt hashes, actual lease and coordination; obtain genuine independent bound M3/source-pool/checker reviews and same-trust READY records before capture. No future PASS, PID, trust, record, timer or runtime result is invented here.',
 'After stages share the original physical unit-finished plus60 deadline. Expanded nominal stage maxima do not guarantee fitting60; a budget refusal stays consumed, without replay/retimestamp/TTL or cap growth.',
 'Source acceptance proves no physical Root tool identity, loaded source, retained lock, hard OS Job, memory or descendant/observer cleanup. A direct-process failure requires separate owned-observer reconciliation before any fresh phase.',
